              "text": "बिताना — bitānā — \"to pass (time)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हमने छुट्टियाँ गाँव में बिताईं। hamne chuṭṭiyā̃ gā̃v meṁ bitāīṁ. We spent the holidays in the village."
