              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने बचपन गाँव में बिताया, usne bacpan gā̃v meṁ bitāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बिताना (bitānā) is the causative partner of बीतना, \"to pass (of time)\", from Sanskrit vṛtta, \"turned; passed\" (CDIAL 12069). गुज़ारना (guzārnā) and बिताना say the same thing; बिताना is the plainer, warmer word."
            }
          ]
